_struct.title                     "Automated refinement of diffraction data obtained from an endothiapepsin crystal treated with fragment 261" 
_struct.pdbx_model_details        
;All 364 structures of this series were generated by an automated refinement pipeline and, thus, not refined to full convergence (e.g. since no manual (re-)building was performed, fragments are missing in the structural model even when present as indicated by the electron density)
